object, reached by two routes.

The non-unimodular counterexample is kept: `G2_det_not_isUnit`, with the generator
primitive and `3` not primitive, so the hypothesis cannot be dropped.

Axioms of everything new: `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`, no `sorryAx`. Build
green under the 4.33.0 pin.

